{"q": 23887, "quiz": 2299, "obj": "P2.ACROSS_PARA", "kind": "mcq", "was": "sentence", "body": "At university, Dr. Ira wanted to give up and go home. Why did she stay?", "why": "السؤال في آخر فقرة وجوابه في أول التي تليها: «I wanted to give up so many times and just go home, but how could I?» ثم «I'm the first woman in my family to go to college and they supported me every step of the way.» و«Besides, I loved exploring this invisible world around me.»", "opts": [{"t": "Her experiments worked well every time.", "dx": "REV", "key": false}, {"t": "Her family helped her, and she loved her work.", "dx": null, "key": true}, {"t": "Her classes were easy, and she had many friends.", "dx": "REV", "key": false}, {"t": "Her friend Tashi wanted her help in the lab.", "dx": "JUMP", "key": false}]},
{"q": 23888, "quiz": 2299, "obj": "P4.CRAFT_MOVE", "kind": "mcq", "was": "sentence", "body": "Dr. Ira says, \"We’re like detectives.\" Why does she use these words?", "why": "التشبيه يقرّب عمل العالِم إلى القارئ، ومعناه في الجملة نفسها: «We’re like detectives who look for clues that help answer all these fascinating questions.»", "opts": [{"t": "Scientists are afraid of questions, too.", "dx": "REV", "key": false}, {"t": "Scientists look for clues and answers, too.", "dx": null, "key": true}, {"t": "Scientists catch bad people, too.", "dx": "LITR", "key": false}, {"t": "Scientists are very serious people, too.", "dx": "REV", "key": false}]},
{"q": 23889, "quiz": 2299, "obj": "P3.PARA_RELATION", "kind": "mcq", "was": "sentence", "body": "One paragraph says, \"some microbes can be very helpful.\" The next paragraph begins, \"Not all microbes are friendly though.\" What does the next paragraph do?", "why": "الفقرة الثانية تستدرك على الأولى بكلمة «though» وتأتي بالوجه الآخر: «Not all microbes are friendly though.» ثم «understand why they make us sick».", "opts": [{"t": "It shows the other side: some microbes are bad for us.", "dx": null, "key": true}, {"t": "It tells the story of Dr. Ira's family.", "dx": "MIX", "key": false}, {"t": "It says the same thing again in new words.", "dx": "REV", "key": false}, {"t": "It gives more examples of helpful microbes.", "dx": "REV", "key": false}]},
{"q": 23890, "quiz": 2299, "obj": "P4.FIT", "kind": "mcq", "was": "judge", "body": "The name of this book is \"Ira Investigates the Invisible\". Is this a good name for it?", "why": "العنوان يوافق ما في النص: «I’m a doctor that studies invisible things.» والمجهر «helps us see things that our eyes aren’t powerful enough to see on their own.»", "opts": [{"t": "No. Dr. Ira sees people with a fever or an earache.", "dx": "REV", "key": false}, {"t": "No. Dr. Ira studies big animals, and everybody can see them.", "dx": "REV", "key": false}, {"t": "Yes. Dr. Ira is invisible, and people in the lab cannot see her.", "dx": "LITR", "key": false}, {"t": "Yes. Dr. Ira studies tiny living things, and our eyes cannot see them.", "dx": null, "key": true}]},
{"q": 23855, "quiz": 2294, "obj": "P1.COMPETITOR", "kind": "mcq", "was": "sentence", "body": "Lucas has more than one idea about the caterpillar in the story. What is his first idea about the things on it?", "why": "للوكاس أكثر من تخمين، والمطلوب أولها: «“Could be fungus sprouting on its back,” said Lucas.»", "opts": [{"t": "Fungus on its back.", "dx": null, "key": true}, {"t": "Eggs under a leaf.", "dx": "MIX", "key": false}, {"t": "Worms from its skin.", "dx": "MIX", "key": false}, {"t": "Wasps in the jar.", "dx": "MIX", "key": false}]},
{"q": 23856, "quiz": 2294, "obj": "P2.UNSIGNALLED", "kind": "mcq", "was": "sentence", "body": "Lucas did a project on bees and wasps. Why is he quiet about it now?", "why": "السبب في الجملة التالية بلا أداة ربط: «Lucas kept quiet. He did not want his mother to know that he had got a C minus for the project, and advice from his stern teacher to make better use of his brain cells!»", "opts": [{"t": "He wants the girls to find the answer.", "dx": "JUMP", "key": false}, {"t": "He is afraid of the wasps in the jar.", "dx": "MIX", "key": false}, {"t": "His project was very good.", "dx": "REV", "key": false}, {"t": "His project was bad.", "dx": null, "key": true}]},
{"q": 23857, "quiz": 2294, "obj": "P2.UNSIGNALLED", "kind": "mcq", "was": "sentence", "body": "The larvae keep away from the vital organs of the caterpillar. Why?", "why": "السبب في الجملة التي تلي: «These feed on the insides of the caterpillar but do not touch the vital organs. They do not want the caterpillar to die as its body gives food to them!»", "opts": [{"t": "Its body is their food, so a dead caterpillar is bad for them.", "dx": null, "key": true}, {"t": "The vital organs are too hard for small larvae.", "dx": "GAP", "key": false}, {"t": "The larvae are already inside their cocoons.", "dx": "MIX", "key": false}, {"t": "The caterpillar attacks the larvae with its silk.", "dx": "REV", "key": false}]},
{"q": 23858, "quiz": 2294, "obj": "P2.WORD_CONTEXT", "kind": "mcq", "was": "sentence", "body": "At the end, the caterpillar is \"like a bodyguard\" for the young wasps. What does a bodyguard do?", "why": "المعنى من الجملة السابقة للكلمة: «It attacks the parasites’ predators and even uses its own silk to make a protective covering for the parasites.» ثم «acting like a bodyguard for its little ones!»", "opts": [{"t": "It eats the bodies of small animals.", "dx": "ECHO", "key": false}, {"t": "It protects the young wasps from predators.", "dx": null, "key": true}, {"t": "It puts many eggs inside a body.", "dx": "MIX", "key": false}, {"t": "It sleeps inside a white cocoon.", "dx": "MIX", "key": false}]},
{"q": 23859, "quiz": 2294, "obj": "P3.CHANGE", "kind": "mcq", "was": "sentence", "body": "How are Valerie and Myra different at the end of the story?", "why": "التغيّر بين أول القصة وآخرها: في أولها «We will use a tweezer to yank out the things piggybacking on the creepy caterpillar!» وفي آخرها «a solemn vow NEVER to be a doctor to ANY creature without learning everything they had to know about it.»", "opts": [{"t": "First they wait patiently. At the end they want to use the tweezer.", "dx": "REV", "key": false}, {"t": "First they know all about wasps. At the end they forget everything.", "dx": "REV", "key": false}, {"t": "First they want to play doctor. At the end they want to learn first.", "dx": null, "key": true}, {"t": "First they are afraid of the caterpillar. At the end they keep it as a pet.", "dx": "JUMP", "key": false}]},
{"q": 23860, "quiz": 2294, "obj": "P4.VS_ALTERNATIVE", "kind": "mcq", "was": "judge", "body": "The girls wanted to use the tweezer. Myra's mother said, \"Wait patiently!\" Was her plan better?", "why": "النص يوازن بين الخيارين: الملقط يؤذي «Have you thought of the trauma you will cause to the caterpillar» واليرقة «does not need any aid from you!» وبالانتظار ظهرت الحقيقة: «The white things you want to yank off are wasp larvae cocoons.»", "opts": [{"t": "Yes. The white things came off, and the caterpillar became a butterfly.", "dx": "JUMP", "key": false}, {"t": "No. Myra's mother had no idea about the white things.", "dx": "REV", "key": false}, {"t": "Yes. The tweezer was bad for the caterpillar, and the truth came out later.", "dx": null, "key": true}, {"t": "No. The days went by, and the girls still knew nothing.", "dx": "REV", "key": false}]},
{"q": 23873, "quiz": 2297, "obj": "P1.COMPETITOR", "kind": "mcq", "was": "sentence", "body": "Ninu asks about pizza, ice cream and soda. What is the problem with ice cream in space?", "why": "في الفقرة ثلاثة أطعمة لكلٍّ سببه، والمطلوب سبب المثلّجات: «There are no freezers in space for ice cream,” said Daddy.»", "opts": [{"t": "Making and baking dough is difficult.", "dx": "MIX", "key": false}, {"t": "It leaves crumbs in the engines.", "dx": "MIX", "key": false}, {"t": "The bubbles behave in strange ways.", "dx": "MIX", "key": false}, {"t": "There are no freezers in space.", "dx": null, "key": true}]},
{"q": 23874, "quiz": 2297, "obj": "P1.COMPETITOR", "kind": "mcq", "was": "sentence", "body": "What does Mummy say about gravity far, far away from Earth?", "why": "النص يقول «almost» ولا ينفي الجاذبية كلّها: «Far, far away from Earth, there is almost no gravity.»", "opts": [{"t": "There is the same gravity.", "dx": "REV", "key": false}, {"t": "There is very strong gravity.", "dx": "REV", "key": false}, {"t": "There is no gravity at all.", "dx": "JUMP", "key": false}, {"t": "There is almost no gravity.", "dx": null, "key": true}]},
{"q": 23875, "quiz": 2297, "obj": "P2.ACROSS_PARA", "kind": "mcq", "was": "sentence", "body": "Chikki thinks food can float back up in an astronaut's mouth. Why is she wrong?", "why": "سؤال تشيكي في فقرة وجوابه في التي تليها: «Won’t the food float back to their mouths when they try to swallow?» ثم «we can swallow because of the muscles in our food pipe–between the mouth and the stomach–and not because of gravity.»", "opts": [{"t": "The gravity in a spaceship is very strong.", "dx": "REV", "key": false}, {"t": "The food in the tubes is very heavy.", "dx": "JUMP", "key": false}, {"t": "The muscles in the food pipe do the work.", "dx": null, "key": true}, {"t": "The astronauts eat upside down in space.", "dx": "MIX", "key": false}]},
{"q": 23876, "quiz": 2297, "obj": "P3.CHANGE", "kind": "mcq", "was": "sentence", "body": "How is astronaut food today different from the food on the first trips into space?", "why": "التغيّر بين البداية واليوم: «When they first started going into space, astronauts ate meat and fruit pastes from tubes.» ثم «options that looked and tasted more like regular food.»", "opts": [{"t": "First it was fish and curry. Today it is only nuts and fruit.", "dx": "MIX", "key": false}, {"t": "First it was regular food. Today it is only pastes from tubes.", "dx": "REV", "key": false}, {"t": "First it was pastes from tubes. Today it is more like regular food.", "dx": null, "key": true}, {"t": "First it was very tasty. Today the astronauts complain about it.", "dx": "REV", "key": false}]},
{"q": 23877, "quiz": 2297, "obj": "P3.MAIN_PARA", "kind": "mcq", "was": "sentence", "body": "Read the end of the book, after the words \"Did you know?\" What is it about?", "why": "الجزء كلّه حقائق قصيرة عن روّاد الفضاء وطعامهم، مثل «Astronauts live in space stations that orbit the earth.» و«Astronauts drink from pouches with special nozzles.»", "opts": [{"t": "The end of the story of Chikki and Ninu.", "dx": "JUMP", "key": false}, {"t": "The reasons for Chikki's love of panipuri.", "dx": "MIX", "key": false}, {"t": "The way to make a pizza in space.", "dx": "MIX", "key": false}, {"t": "More things about the life and food of astronauts.", "dx": null, "key": true}]},
{"q": 23878, "quiz": 2297, "obj": "P4.FIT", "kind": "mcq", "was": "judge", "body": "The name of this story is \"Panipuri inside a Spaceship\". Is this a good name for it?", "why": "العنوان يجمع موضوع القصة وأمنية تشيكي في آخرها: «But when I become an astronaut, I’m going to take panipuri along!»", "opts": [{"t": "No. The story is about school, and space is not in it.", "dx": "REV", "key": false}, {"t": "Yes. Mummy puts panipuri in a tube for the children's lunch.", "dx": "MIX", "key": false}, {"t": "No. Chikki hates panipuri, and she never asks for it.", "dx": "REV", "key": false}, {"t": "Yes. The story is about food in space, and Chikki wants panipuri there.", "dx": null, "key": true}]}
]$spec$::jsonb;
  e jsonb; o jsonb; r record;
  v_q bigint; v_obj bigint; v_id bigint; v_key bigint; v_dx jsonb; i int; n int;
  n_done int := 0; n_skip int := 0;
begin
  /* ── الحرّاس: كلُّ سؤالٍ في اختباره، من مكتبة المادّة ٧، وما يتحوّل بلا إجابة ── */
  for r in select (x->>'q')::bigint q, (x->>'quiz')::bigint quiz from jsonb_array_elements(spec) x loop
    if not exists (select 1 from questions qq join items it on it.quiz_id = qq.quiz_id join lessons l on l.id = it.lesson_id
                    join courses c on c.id = l.course_id
                    where qq.id = r.q and qq.quiz_id = r.quiz and c.subject_id = 7 and qq.retired_at is null) then
      raise exception 'السؤال % ليس في الاختبار % من مكتبة المادّة ٧', r.q, r.quiz;
    end if;
  end loop;
  select count(*) into n from answers a
   where a.question_id in (select (x->>'q')::bigint from jsonb_array_elements(spec) x where x->>'kind' <> 'relabel');
  if n > 0 then raise exception 'على الأسئلة % إجابة — لا يُحوَّل سؤالٌ أجاب عنه أحد', n; end if;

  for e in select * from jsonb_array_elements(spec) loop
    v_q := (e->>'q')::bigint;
    select kind, body, objective_id into r from questions where id = v_q;
    select id into strict v_obj from objectives where subject_id = 7 and code = e->>'obj';

    if e->>'kind' = 'relabel' then
      if r.objective_id is distinct from v_obj then update questions set objective_id = v_obj where id = v_q; n_done := n_done + 1;
      else n_skip := n_skip + 1; end if;
      continue;
    end if;

    if r.kind = e->>'kind' and r.body = e->>'body' then n_skip := n_skip + 1; continue; end if;
    if r.kind <> e->>'was' then raise exception 'السؤال % نمطُه % لا %', v_q, r.kind, e->>'was'; end if;

    update question_keys set correct_id = null, correct_ids = null where question_id = v_q;
    delete from options where question_id = v_q;

    if e->>'kind' = 'mcq' then
      v_key := null; v_dx := '{}'::jsonb; i := 0;
      for o in select * from jsonb_array_elements(e->'opts') loop
        i := i + 1;
        insert into options (question_id, position, body) values (v_q, i, o->>'t') returning id into v_id;
        if (o->>'key')::boolean then v_key := v_id;
        elsif o->>'dx' is not null then v_dx := v_dx || jsonb_build_object(v_id::text, o->>'dx'); end if;
      end loop;
      if v_key is null then raise exception 'السؤال % بلا مفتاح', v_q; end if;
      update questions set kind = 'mcq', body = e->>'body', objective_id = v_obj where id = v_q;
      update question_keys set correct_id = v_key, correct_ids = null, accept = null, bank = null, wrong_map = null,
             dx_map = v_dx, explanation = e->>'why' where question_id = v_q;
    else   -- matching
      i := 0;
      for o in select * from jsonb_array_elements(e->'prompts') loop
        i := i + 1;
        insert into options (question_id, position, body, item_key) values (v_q, i, o->>'t', o->>'k');
      end loop;
      update questions set kind = 'matching', body = e->>'body', objective_id = v_obj, points = i where id = v_q;
      update question_keys set correct_id = null, correct_ids = null, wrong_map = null, dx_map = '{}'::jsonb,
             bank = e->'bank', accept = jsonb_build_object('pairs', e->'pairs'), explanation = e->>'why' where question_id = v_q;
    end if;
    get diagnostics n = row_count;
    if n <> 1 then raise exception 'السؤال % بلا سطر مفتاح', v_q; end if;
    n_done := n_done + 1;
  end loop;

  if n_done + n_skip <> 47 then raise exception 'عُدِّل % وتُخطّي % والمنتظر 47', n_done, n_skip; end if;
  raise notice '259: عُدِّل % سؤالاً · تُخطّي %', n_done, n_skip;
end $$;

insert into public.sql_log (n, title, applied_at)
values ('259', 'مكتبة بيان · المستوى الحادي عشر (الدفعة الثالثة): أسئلةُ الضغط والحكم تصير اختياراً من متعدّد', now())
on conflict (n) do update set applied_at = now();
